prompt:
Write a short, confident showcase card that makes a first-time visitor see StoryVocabs as a serious, premium exam-vocabulary course worth trying today.

PRODUCT FACTS (the ONLY numbers and claims you may use):
{facts}

Pick ONE angle per post and build it around ONE real number from the facts (for example the number of words, stories or packs, or a learner count if the facts list one). Show what the learner actually gets, not adjectives. Never invent ratings, reviews, user counts, results or comparisons; if a number is not in the facts, do not mention it.

HOOK STYLE: {hook_instruction}

End the body by inviting them to start with the free packs.
